with another and controlled via a single connection.;
#X text 240 178 Note: in case of LED dot matrix display only write_bits
and write_reg commands will work as expected;
#X text 240 218 Note: 7-segment LED display supports only this charset:
-_0123456789ABCDEFGHIJLOPSUbcdhnoqrtu;
#X text 240 258 Note: if the device address argument is -1 or omitted
\, requested action is applied for all devices in a chain.;
